# SECOPS1: Do not accidentally stage or commit local secrets in this public repo.
# Gitignore does not protect already tracked files or history: QA scans both.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*service-account*.json
*service_role*.json
*.private-key
*.secret-key
# Do not add broad rules for all .json/.sql files: public reference
# data, SQL schema, and IndexedNow verification can be intentional.
